</svg></div><div class="text-block-9">Zaustavi audio</div></a></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="mobile" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="image-group margin-bottom margin-medium"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/digi-20-2b-20tron-204-20-2b-20pozadina.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 93vw, (max-width: 767px) 86vw, 100vw" alt="DIGITRON" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/digi-20-2b-20tron-204-20-2b-20pozadina-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/digi-20-2b-20tron-204-20-2b-20pozadina.png 700w" class="heroheader05_image image-size image-i-bi"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background hidden-image-background"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/ar-20ikona-20-20s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Nakon II. svjetskog rata život u Bujštini bio je težak i neizvjestan, pa su se mnogi odlučili iseliti. Da bi zaustavile iseljavanje, jugoslavenske vlasti su lokalnom stanovništvu omogućile nova radna mjesta, pa je 1. veljače 1971. u Bujama utemeljeno poduzeće za proizvodnju digitalne elektronike - Digitron. <br/><br/>Prvi europski džepni kalkulator bio je Digitronov db-800 proizveden 1971. godine, što je gotovo neobjašnjiv uspjeh s obzirom na tehnološku zaostalost tadašnje Jugoslavije.</div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/digi-20-2b-20tron-204-20-2b-20pozadina.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 465.9765625px, 47vw" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/digi-20-2b-20tron-204-20-2b-20pozadina-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/digi-20-2b-20tron-204-20-2b-20pozadina.png 700w" class="heroheader05_image image-size image-i-bi"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background hidden-image-background"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/ar-20ikona-20-20s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">Godine neizvjesnosti<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/scan10021-20-20god.-20neizvj.-20-201.2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/scan10021-20-20god.-20neizvj.-20-201.2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/scan10021-20-20god.-20neizvj.-20-201.2.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 76vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_3e1661eb-65af-2569-0a44-13b317505df9-c3299634" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium hide-heading3">Godine neizvjesnosti<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Iako su Italija i Jugoslavija 1954. potpisale Londonski memorandum koji je trebao riješiti granična pitanja između tih država, još je dugo stanje u Istri bilo vrlo neizvjesno.<br/></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_3e1661eb-65af-2569-0a44-13b317505e15-c3299634" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">I jedna i druga strana tražile su više teritorija, prijetilo se i zveckalo s oružjem.<br/><br/>U takvoj atmosferi život je bio težak pa je Bujštinu u periodu od 1954. do 1964. napustilo gotovo 10.000 stanovnika u potrazi za sigurnijim životom i zaposlenjem, a iza njih je ostalo napušteno 10.000 hektara obradive zemlje.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/scan10022-20-20god.-20neizvj.-20-202.2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/scan10022-20-20god.-20neizvj.-20-202.2.-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/scan10022-20-20god.-20neizvj.-20-202.2.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 76vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">Osnivanje Digitrona<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/scan10092-20-20osniv.-20digi.-20-201.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/scan10092-20-20osniv.-20digi.-20-201-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/scan10092-20-20osniv.-20digi.-20-201.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 76vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_3c5a6107-9d5e-d67d-55f3-665a9bd0bfbb-c3299634" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium hide-heading3">Osnivanje Digitrona<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Digitron je osnovan u sastavu vanjsko-trgovinskog poduzeća &quot;Buje-export&quot;, a elektronika i računala su izabrani jer takvih proizvoda nije bilo na jugoslavenskom tržištu.<br/></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-d08fcbcf-ffbf-0c93-1735-6f9d8b05fe9b-c3299634" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Sami početak je bio vrlo skroman. U zapuštenom prostoru bivšeg vatrogasnog doma dva inženjera, dva tehničara i 22 nekvalificirane radnice montirali su dva tipa stolnih računala na bazi japanske dokumentacije.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/scan10092-20-20osniv.-20digi.-20-202.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/scan10092-20-20osniv.-20digi.-20-202-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/scan10092-20-20osniv.-20digi.-20-202.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 76vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">Prvi modeli<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/digitron-20db-201212-s.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/digitron-20db-201212-s-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/digitron-20db-201212-s.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 92vw, 31vw" class="featured-image image-size-mob-bigger"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_3e1661eb-65af-2569-0a44-13b317505e36-c3299634" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium hide-heading3">Prvi modeli<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Prvi modeli koji su izašli iz Digitronovih pogona bili su stolni kalkulatori db 1200 i db 1212, no Digitron su svjetsku slavu donijeli njegovi &quot;mališani&quot;, kako su džepnim kalkulatorima tepali radnici Digitrona.<br/></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_17f21035-0c9b-493a-74da-804f75f0d89e-c3299634" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Džepni kalkulator db 800 u anale je ušao kao prvi europski džepni kalkulator, a njegov nasljednik model db 801 dobivao je nagrade i priznanja gdje god se pojavio.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/digitron-20db-20800.png" loading="lazy" alt="Dashboard mockup" class="featured-image image-size small no-background"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section>